    "Drag a color in the picture. Nearby color families move together.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在影像中拖曳某個顏色。鄰近的色彩家族會一起移動。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag a point. Click to add one. Double-click a point to remove it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖曳控制點。按一下可加入。按兩下控制點可移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag inside the wheel. Angle sets hue, distance sets saturation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在色環內拖曳。角度決定色相，距離決定飽和度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag on the layer to place a guide. Draw at least two lines.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在圖層上拖曳以放置參考線。至少繪製兩條線。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag or scroll to move around; double-click switches between Fit and 100%": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖曳或捲動以移動檢視；按兩下可在「符合視窗」與「100%」之間切換"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag to resize the panel": {
