    "Text color": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字顏色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text fields keep standard macOS editing keys. Dialogs share the Apply/Cancel assignments above. Numeric fields use Up/Down, with Shift for larger steps. Standard macOS commands include ⌘Q to quit and ⌃⌘F for full screen. The shortcut editor itself always uses Return to save and Esc to cancel when not recording.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字欄位保留標準 macOS 編輯按鍵。對話框沿用上述的套用/取消配置。數值欄位使用向上/向下鍵，按住 Shift 可加大幅度。標準 macOS 指令包含 ⌘Q 結束與 ⌃⌘F 進入全螢幕。快速鍵編輯器在未錄製時，一律用 Return 儲存、Esc 取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The brush trails the pointer on a string this long, so a shaky hand still draws a smooth line": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "筆刷會在這段長度內追隨指標，即使手不穩也能畫出平滑線條"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The characters to draw with, in any order: each spot gets the one whose ink best matches its tone": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用來繪圖的字元，順序不拘：每個位置會採用墨色最符合其色調的字元"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The height of each line of characters": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每行字元的高度"
          }
